#. translators: 1: heading on the settings screen, 2: file button label, 3: submit button label.
#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:188
#, php-format
msgid "Open the Fast Index settings. Under %1$s choose the .json file (%2$s) and click %3$s. The screen then lists the email address and key ID of the key. The private key is stored in your database and is never shown."
